    "### 1(c) Abridged life table\n",
    "Construction (pooled sexes, radix l0 = 100,000):\n",
    "- m_x = deaths / person-years\n",
    "- q_x = n m_x / (1 + (n - a_x) m_x), for the closed intervals; q_85+ = 1\n",
    "- l_(x+n) = l_x (1 - q_x); d_x = l_x q_x\n",
    "- L_x = n l_(x+n) + a_x d_x for closed intervals; L_85+ = l_85 / m_85+\n",
    "- T_x = sum of L from x upward; e_x = T_x / l_x"
   ]
