    "**Notes: why the ageing district.** D24 grew 9.4% between 2020 and 2025 but fell 0.97% in 2025 to 2026, so its past trend and current dynamics disagree. That makes it the best test of whether trend extrapolation is adequate. D01 (growth 10.1% then 0.76%) is consistent with its trend."
   ]
