   "source": [
    "### 2(a) Arithmetic and geometric growth\n",
    "With opening counts P(2020) and P(2025) (t = 5 years):\n",
    "- **Arithmetic:** P(t) = P(2025) + g t, with g = (P2025 - P2020)/5 persons per year\n",
    "- **Geometric:** P(t) = P(2025)(1 + r)^t, with r = (P2025/P2020)^(1/5) - 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "c27",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
